<title>USA: Compaq extends lead in market share-report.</title>
<headline>Compaq extends lead in market share-report.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compaq Computer Corp, the PC industry leader, increased its market share  by 2.1 percentage points in the second quarter from a year earlier, to 11.7 percent, the market research company Dataquest said Monday.</p>
<p>International Business Machines Corp's market share rose to 8.8 percent from 8.6 percent a year earlier, according to preliminary data from Dataquest.</p>
<p>Hewlett-Packard Co's market share rose to 5.5 percent from 4.1 percent, and Dell Computer Corp's share advanced to 5.3 percent from 3.9 percent.</p>
</text>
